## Overlap

- **`sync-timedb-startup-day-close-contract.mdc`** — checkpoint-complete days with raw still on disk are owned by startup async **`DAY_CLOSE`**; tar seal skips those days to avoid double seal
- **`sync-timedb-archive-janitor-contract.mdc`** — steady-state seal/raw/`.tar` via **`DAY_CLOSE`** unchanged
- **`sync-timedb-db-before-archive-contract.mdc`** — startup raw removal is separate; tar seal uses filesystem raw gate only
- **`sync-timedb-lock-and-archive-contract.mdc`** — seal locks, shrink guard, idempotent zst
- **`process-title-and-pool-labels.mdc`** — thread title `startup-tar-seal-preflight`
